&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us ...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cecconi’s Amsterdam, part of the global Soho House brand, brings classic Italian dining to life in a vibrant, elegant setting. Known for its timeless dishes, buzzing atmosphere, and exceptional service, Cecconi’s offers an inspiring environment for hospitality professionals passionate about great food and genuine guest experiences. Cecconi’s serves hand-made pasta, seafood and dishes from Italy using the finest ingredients. In addition to the original restaurant in Mayfair, London, Cecconi’s has locations in Miami, West Hollywood, Istanbul and Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our aim is to hire skilled and passionate &lt;strong&gt;Waiters&lt;/strong&gt; to join the team at &lt;strong&gt;Cecconi&#39;s Amsterdam&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for people who take genuine pride in their craft. At Cecconi&#39;s, great hospitality goes beyond taking orders and serving food. It&#39;s about anticipating guest needs, building meaningful connections and delivering experiences that keep guests coming back.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside passionate hospitality professionals who hold themselves to high standards and are committed to excellence. As a Waiter, you&#39;ll manage your own section, build relationships with guests and play a key role in delivering the warm, attentive service Cecconi&#39;s is known for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver warm, personable and professional service throughout the guest journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently guide guests through our food and beverage menus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a busy section while maintaining exceptional attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build genuine relationships with members, regular guests and visitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work collaboratively with kitchen, bar and floor teams to deliver a seamless experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently uphold Cecconi&#39;s and Soho House service standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support private events and other operational areas when require&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience as a Waiter or in a guest-facing hospitality role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a busy, fast-paced service environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Naturally warm, engaging and guest-focused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a collaborative mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to remain calm and organised during high-volume service periods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for food, beverage and hospitality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible availability, including evenings, weekends and public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required; additional languages are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for hospitality professionals who love the energy of a full restaurant, take pride in managing a bustling section and enjoy building relationships with guests who return time and time again. At Cecconi&#39;s, you&#39;ll be part of a thriving service environment where outstanding hospitality is appreciated and recognised.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about hospitality, thrive in a fast-paced environment and want to work alongside some of the industry&#39;s most talented professionals, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cecconi&#39;s offers competitive compensation packages that feature global benefits and perks. Whether you’re seeking entry-level employment or a new opportunity to expand your profession, we offer training to develop the technical and managerial skills necessary to enhance your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation: Salary above Horeca CAO. &lt;strong&gt;From 2.511,89 € to 2.718,95 €, based on experience &lt;/strong&gt;(If younger than 20 y/o no youth salary will be applied)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel allowance &amp;gt; 7.5km (75% of travel costs will be reimbursed)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthy team meals during your shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soho Friends Membership with discounts on F&amp;amp;B, rooms and Cowshed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnership discounts (Go-Vital, One Fit, Swapfiets and many more)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Friends &amp;amp; Family rate for rooms (discount depends on period &amp;amp; occupancy)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One paid moving day per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two paid volunteering days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce a star and you could be eligible to receive a €300 (gross) bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
