&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waiter / Waitress, Cecconi&#39;s Amsterdam&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Full-time or part-time (2-3 days per week) | €2,511 - €2,711 gross per month, excluding tips&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cecconi&#39;s is Amsterdam&#39;s go-to for Italian dining: great food, great wine, great energy. We&#39;re looking for professional waiters who take pride in the details and love making guests feel like the most important person in the room.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver polished, warm and confident service on the floor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide guests through the menu and wine list with real knowledge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the kitchen, bar and your team to keep every service running smoothly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create the kind of evening guests talk about and come back for&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your schedule&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time or part-time, 2-3 days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mostly evening shifts, with some day shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekends are part of the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a professional restaurant, or serious ambition to learn at this level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent guest-facing skills and a polished appearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English; Dutch or Italian is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player who stays calm and sharp when it&#39;s busy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to work in the Netherlands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€2,511 - €2,711 gross per month for a full-time contract (part-time pro rata), plus tips&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff meals / uniform / holiday pay / pension / travel allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Training in Italian wine, menu and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team that&#39;s serious about the craft and still has fun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How to apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply with a few quick details; a CV is optional. We&#39;ll get back to you within [48 hours] and invite you for a conversation and a trial shift.&lt;/p&gt;
