&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who You Are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience leading HTA submissions and pricing negotiations across multiple international markets, ideally including Europe and other global regions, particularly in rare diseases and orphan conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of international healthcare systems, pricing and reimbursement frameworks, and regulatory environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience generating and leveraging data for HTA submissions and pricing negotiations, with a strong external network of agencies and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable presenting at senior levels and engaging with external thought leaders globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing complex, cross-functional and multicultural teams (including external partners).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of product commercialization processes with a hands-on, solution-oriented mindset for building scalable processes and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rewarding Those Who Make the Mission Possible&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market leading compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work model - we value your flexibility in how you work, but encourage time in the office to strengthen our culture, collaboration, and sense of community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide career development through regular feedback, continuous education and professional development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We celebrate strong performance with financial rewards, peer-to-peer recognition, and growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
